    "body": "@VibhuJawa - In an ideal world, the `nunique` aggregation would be faster than your workaround.  However, since dask is using `apply`,  I would expect your version to be much faster for large partitions (apply is slow).  I'm not sure if there is a clean way to remove the use of `apply` from the dask code -  I know @quasiben has been pondering this lately.",
